# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages does not support query-string matching in _redirects —
# the path is matched verbatim, so a rule like `/?lang=ar` matches EVERY request
# to `/` (the `?lang=ar` is ignored) and turns into an unconditional redirect.
# That previously broke `/` by redirecting it to `/ar/`. The Astro site already
# serves English at `/` and Arabic at `/ar/` via dedicated routes, so no
# backward-compat redirect is needed for the legacy Flutter `?lang=` form.
